      "content": "yeah i know i should talk to someone but i cant really get an appointment until next week and i'm totally exhausted from coughing all night. i just need to know if there is a major danger or if i'm overthinking it? like is it actually going to cause a reaction or is it fine? i really need something that works fast.",
